# Everything baked into the "bundled" read-only asset partition
# (see main/CMakeLists.txt's spiffs_create_partition_image + storage.c)
# is personal/local by default -- most of it (fun clips) is converted from
# whatever audio you own via sync_pi_audio.py, and songs like the ones this
# project was originally tested against (Ring of Fire, Banana Boat, ...) are
# copyrighted and don't belong in a public repo or a build anyone can
# download. Generate your own from your own media library; only the
# synthesized (not copyrighted) operator prompt ships as a real default.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!operator.wav
